/* MP Loc Temple More2 — 神殿补记房第二批增量（26 页）
   More2 Hub / 三个分区 Hub / Event 13-22 与 Season Extra 2，均为「接近 → 结果」两页结构。
   接近页只写环境与动静、判检定、付代价（钱，或技能替代的 1 点疲劳），不结算。
   结果页用 $mpTempleEv* 分成败：成功才推进 $mpLocEvents_Temple、$mpLocProgress_Temple
   与逐事件旗标 $mpDone_Temple_*；失败只加 stress/tiredness/pain，0 钱 0 线索 0 旗标。不改 boot。 */

:: MP Loc Temple More2 Hub [nobr]
杂役廊后墙的包铁皮小门后是一间更窄的屋子，矮桌上嵌着磨亮的石板，铜环上串着几块木牌。管屋的老修士把炭条推到桌角：「牌分三处挂。前殿最急，回廊与库房次之，地底下的，等手上沾过一件事再碰。」
<br><br>
接了牌，当日晚钟前必须回话。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>约旦偶尔在炭盆边烘着湿袖口；<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼来送旧谱时，会把牌上的字念一遍。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回杂役水牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[回前殿去 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) gte 1>><<mplampicon>><<link [[去回廊库房 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) gte 2>><<mpcellaricon>><<link [[下地底与院墙外 (0:04)|MP Loc Temple More2 Vault]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) lt 1>>回廊那头的门还锁着，老修士说，先办成一件，牌才肯往那边走。<br><</if>>
<<if ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) gte 1 and ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) lt 2>>地底下的灯还没点，老修士说，得再攒一件事。<</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple More2 Front [nobr]
前殿的门槛被鞋底磨出凹槽。塔梯口的钟绳垂下来，末端打着新结；圣水盆边的青苔又厚了一层；祭坛左侧的铜烛座还歪着，蜡油凝在石面上。
<br><br>
管钟的老匠人、管水的修女和管事的修女各守一段，谁也不先开口。殿里的事都不大，可一件压着一件。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回补记房 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><br>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_13>>晨钟的绳结重新打好了，塔梯口那道铜销的响声隔着门也能听见。<br><<else>><<walkicon>><<link [[去校钟销 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 13]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_14>>两只陶罐都装满了，洗礼和安魂礼错开了时辰。<br><<else>><<mpwatchicon>><<link [[分派两场圣水 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 14]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_15>>长椅旁立起了木牌，两拨香客各坐一边。<br><<else>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[替香客立一块木牌 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 15]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_20>>烧穿的帷布换了下来，铜烛座重新钉稳。<br><<else>><<link [[扶起倒下的烛台 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 20]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister [nobr]
回廊的窗只开半扇，穿堂风把灯焰吹得贴向一边。圣器库的铜锁挂在门环上；地窖口飘出一点酸甜的酒气；旧档室的门比别处矮一截。<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼抱着谱本从廊那头走过，脚步很轻。<</if>>
<br><br>
老修士说，库房、地窖和旧档室丢的与藏的，往往在同一条回廊上。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回补记房 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><br>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_16>>库房的锁换过了，钥匙只挂在管库修士腰上。<br><<else>><<investigateicon>><<link [[验库房那把锁 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 16]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_19>>地窖的木桶封了口，账上的数目也对上了。<br><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[查地窖里那桶私酒 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 19]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_22>>旧档室最里面那格空了，蓝布卷不知被谁取走。<br><<else>><<link [[跑旧档室取卷子 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 22]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_Season2>>供桌上的藤与蜡换过一轮，窄木牌翻了个面。<br><<else>><<link [[摆节令供桌 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Season Extra 2]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple More2 Vault [nobr]
往下的石阶越来越窄，墙根渗水，鞋底发滑。北墙外那片旧墓比别处低一截，积水迟迟不退；渡口的风顺着墙缺口灌进来，院墙外的低地和门廊也归这条线管。
<br><br>
<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>约旦提着灯站在阶口：「先看清路，再决定先动哪一处。」<<else>>一名神殿修士提着灯站在阶口：「先看清路，再决定先动哪一处。」<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回补记房 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><br>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_17>>那户人家的灯亮了一夜，老人把名字念完了。<br><<else>><<mpritualicon>><<link [[守夜听老人念名 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 17]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_18>>有名字的墓碑重新立了起来，水退下去半寸。<br><<else>><<mpcellaricon>><<link [[按仪迁墓 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 18]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Temple_21>>侧廊腾出了一段地方，朝圣的人挨着墙睡下了。<br><<else>><<mpcarryicon>><<link [[安置朝圣队伍 (0:06)|MP Loc Temple Event 21]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
钟楼上的第一声迟了半刻。前殿门外的香客抬头看塔，有人把念珠收回袖子，转身往集市那边去。老匠人从塔梯上下来，耳里塞着棉絮，只说：「销子退出来半指，再拉一次，绳结就散了。」塔梯很陡，铜销只有两指宽，敲重了会裂，敲轻了不回位。执事攥着铜锤站在下面，锤柄上缠的布条已经磨破。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回前殿 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[上塔敲铜销 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set $mpTempleEv13 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv13 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 130 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link [[买铜销请匠人 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Event 13 After]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($money or 0) gte 130>><<money -130>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv13 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买铜销请匠人 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 13 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv13 to ($mpTempleEv13 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv13 is "fail">>销子没能归位，铜面倒崩掉一小块，锤柄从掌心滑脱。老匠人摆手让你停手，钟绳仍旧松着，第一声到底没有补上。你从塔梯下来时腿在抖，掌心磨出一道红痕，殿门外的人已经散了大半。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><<else>>销子归位，你握住钟绳慢慢加力，闷了半刻的钟声终于铺开。塔下的香客停住脚，卖花的孩子抬起头。老匠人把耳里的棉絮取出来，冲你点了点头，说这口钟还能再撑几年。你把手上的铜味在裤腿上蹭掉，才走下塔梯。钟绳的结也重新打紧了。<<set $mpDone_Temple_13 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<athletics 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前殿里 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
前殿的石盆见了底，盆沿那圈青苔干得卷起来。管圣水的修女把铜勺搁下，说后园泉眼昨夜出得少，暗渠的水位也低，可今天偏偏排了两场：上午船主家孩子的洗礼，午后码头老脚夫的安魂礼。她把两只蒙白布的陶罐并排摆上阶，看了你一眼，没有替你做主。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回前殿 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[下暗渠引泉水 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple Event 14 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set $mpTempleEv14 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv14 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<link [[买罐雇挑夫 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 14 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150>><<money -150>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv14 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买罐雇挑夫 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 14 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv14 to ($mpTempleEv14 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv14 is "fail">>水到底没有提够，木桶在铁栅边翻了一半，肩头也撞在石壁上。等提回前殿，洗礼的时辰已经过去，船主家的女佣抱着孩子站在廊下，没有看你。你把空罐放回阶上，袖口还在滴水。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><<else>>你把两只陶罐都提到阶前，先注满洗礼那一只，再给安魂礼留下半罐。修女用炭笔在布上改了个时辰，两家人各自进了侧廊。船主家的女佣把布角的银币推回来，你没有接。阶上的水痕慢慢收干，铜勺也擦亮了。<<set $mpDone_Temple_14 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<tending 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前殿里 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
午后的前殿比集市还吵。两拨香客争靠柱子的长椅，铜钱撒了半地，几个孩子趴下去捡。院角支着一个小摊，蓝布上摆着几截发黄的骨头。<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>一个抱谱本的修士<</if>>贴着墙根挪过来，压低声音：「那布上绣的名字，和匣底刻的不是一个。」管事修女的嗓子已经哑了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回前殿 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[分队立木牌 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 15 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpTempleEv15 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv15 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 140 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<link [[出钱让出长椅 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Event 15 After]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($money or 0) gte 140>><<money -140>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv15 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出钱让出长椅 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 15 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv15 to ($mpTempleEv15 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv15 is "fail">>两拨人到底没有分开，话越说越急，谁也没有听。木牌被撞倒在地，铜钱再滚一遍，晚祷的钟响时，长椅仍旧空着。你站在散开的人群边上，喉咙发干，袖口不知什么时候蹭了一道灰。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<else>>木牌立在长椅两端，两拨人各坐一边，中间留出一条过道。摊主收了蓝布从侧门走了，骨头匣没有卖出去。管事修女扶着柱子坐下，冲你摆摆手，让你去喝口水。有人把草垫铺开，又替她挪来一只矮凳。<<set $mpDone_Temple_15 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<willpower 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前殿里 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 16 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
圣器库的锁扣被人从门框上起下来又钉回去，钉眼比原先粗了一圈。管库的老修士蹲在门槛边，用指腹摸那道新痕，说少了两块蜂蜡、一只锡酒壶、半桶灯油。库房后墙的气窗开着一条缝，窗台上的灰被蹭掉一小块；更簿昨夜中间空了一格，没有人补。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回回廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[验锁查钉痕 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple Event 16 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpTempleEv16 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv16 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 180 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>><<link [[换锁再补柜门 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 16 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 180>><<money -180>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv16 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">换锁再补柜门 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 16 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv16 to ($mpTempleEv16 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv16 is "fail">>锁上的痕迹到底没能理清，铜屑越抠越乱，旧钉孔和新钉孔混在一处，分不清哪道是昨夜留下的。老修士把清点簿合上，没有问你结果，只把钥匙串重新系回腰上。库房外的渔网被风吹得贴住墙，巷里没有一点脚步声。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>锁扣的新钉比旧孔细半圈，钉帽上的锤痕是斜的，不是神殿匠人的手法。你把气窗内侧那点新蜡指给老修士看，他沉默了一会儿，把钥匙串解下来放在桌上。库房今晚换了人守，锁也换了新的。<<set $mpDone_Temple_16 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回回廊里 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 17 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
渡口后头的低洼地，屋里潮得能拧出水。墙角的裂缝灌进风，灯焰贴着墙倒；屋梁上几只空鱼篓一碰就响。老妇人攥着一根断了的念珠绳坐在床沿，听见门响就抬起头。<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>约旦<<else>>同来的修士<</if>>在门口停了停，说：「先别念经，先听。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回地底廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Vault]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[守夜听老人念名 (0:14)|MP Loc Temple Event 17 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpTempleEv17 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv17 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 160 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link [[买炭添灯 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 17 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 160>><<money -160>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv17 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买炭添灯 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 17 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv17 to ($mpTempleEv17 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv17 is "fail">>灯芯爆了一下，屋里的话断在半句上，老人的肩膀跟着一抖。她重新低下头，念珠绳从指间滑下去。你在冷屋子里坐到天快亮，除了自己的呼吸，什么也没有听见。屋外的鱼篓又碰了一下，声音很空。<<stress 6>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><<else>>你守在床沿，等老人把那个名字念完，又轻声问了一句。她说起年轻时在钟楼底下送饭的日子，说起换绳的那一年。天亮时她把念珠绳交到你手里，说这样就不响了。屋外的天光从门缝里挤进来，鱼篓的影子落到地上。<<set $mpDone_Temple_17 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<willpower 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回地底廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Vault]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 18 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
北墙外的旧墓比别处低一截，雨水积在坟垄之间，迟迟不退。管墓的老修士把白布、麻绳和一罐清水摆上石板，说最靠墙的三座石棺已经泡在水里，今天最多只起得动一座。墙缺口外站着个提竹篮的妇人，篮里是几张纸钱，她没有进来，也没有走。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回地底廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Vault]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[按仪捡骨入龛 (0:14)|MP Loc Temple Event 18 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set $mpTempleEv18 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv18 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 220 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<link [[雇工抬棺 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 18 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 220>><<money -220>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv18 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">雇工抬棺 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 18 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv18 to ($mpTempleEv18 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv18 is "fail">>棺底的灰吸饱了水，一碰就散，白布兜不住，几块碎骨滑回泥里。家属在墙外看着，把纸钱攥成一团。老修士让你们先停手，说等水退一点再来，可谁都知道水只会涨。你蹲在泥里，鞋底陷下去半寸。<<stress 6>><<tiredness 4>><<pain 2>><<else>>头骨用白布托住，棺底的土另装了一袋，按顺序请进最外一层的空龛。墙外的妇人走进来，把纸钱压在龛脚。老修士用清水洗了手，说这块碑今天就重新立起来。坟垄之间露出几道干土，水声轻下去一截。<<set $mpDone_Temple_18 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<tending 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回地底廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Vault]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 19 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
地窖东头的杂物间飘出甜味。掀开麻袋，一排木桶的桶口封着新蜡，蜡上按着一枚不是神殿的私印。管酒的修士站在门口，手里攥着一把铜漏斗，袖口沾着几粒紫果皮，说李子是后园落的，钱都记在修屋顶的账上。楼梯上方有脚步在下楼，走得很慢。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回回廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[封坛交给管事 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 19 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpTempleEv19 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv19 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 160 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<link [[出钱封桶口 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 19 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 160>><<money -160>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv19 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出钱封桶口 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 19 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv19 to ($mpTempleEv19 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv19 is "fail">>灯焰忽然暗了一下，你手里的活计做到一半就断了头绪。管酒的修士趁机把铜漏斗收进袖子里，桶盖重新压上麻袋。楼梯上的脚步停了一停，又退了回去。你只落得一手酒气，账本还压在秤砣底下。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<else>>账本最后一页的数目对上了，缺的是经手人的签名。你把木桶逐一封口，写明日期，交给管事的修女过目。管酒的修士没有再辩解，只把铜漏斗留在桌上。修屋顶的折子被重新递了上去。<<set $mpDone_Temple_19 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<willpower 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回回廊里 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 20 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
晚祷进行到一半，祭坛左侧的高烛台歪了。白烛带着火苗栽下来，正落在帷布下摆，火顺着旧布往上爬。前排的人先闻到焦味，随后喊成一片。<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼<<else>>一个抱谱本的修士<</if>>用袍袖去拍，袖口立刻焦了一块；<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>约旦<<else>>一名神殿修士<</if>>把最靠近火的那排长椅往后推。管祭器的修女提着半罐水跑来，脚下踩到蜡油，险些滑倒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回前殿 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[扑火护帷布 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 20 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set $mpTempleEv20 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv20 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>><<link [[出钱雇工挑水 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Event 20 After]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200>><<money -200>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv20 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出钱雇工挑水 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 20 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv20 to ($mpTempleEv20 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv20 is "fail">>火苗窜上帷布上沿，烟把人逼退两步。你被焦味呛得直咳，退下来时手背燎起一串红点。等沙桶传进来，帷布已经烧穿了一大块，殿里全是焦甜的味，前排的人挤在殿门外不肯进来。<<stress 6>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 3>><<else>>湿毡压住帷布下摆，火被一层层按灭。你踩着蜡油把最后一张长椅推开，又扶住险些滑倒的管祭器修女。有人端来一盆湿沙，把冒烟的地方盖住。殿门被推开，风灌进来，焦味才慢慢淡下去。管祭器的修女说，帷布明天就换，烛座也得重新钉。<<set $mpDone_Temple_20 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<pain 1>><<athletics 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前殿里 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Front]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 21 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
朝圣队比名册上写的早到一天，三十多人挤在门外，推着一辆盖油布的车，车上有病人，也有一口上锁的木匣。领队的老者把文书举过头顶，说路上遭了雨，只求在殿里歇一夜。他身后的孩子已经坐在地上，鞋底磨穿。管事的修女攥着库房钥匙，始终没有开门。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回地底廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Vault]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[安置朝圣队伍 (0:14)|MP Loc Temple Event 21 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpTempleEv21 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv21 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 170 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<link [[备粥铺草 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 21 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 170>><<money -170>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv21 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">备粥铺草 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 21 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv21 to ($mpTempleEv21 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv21 is "fail">>草垫只够铺到一半，热水也来不及烧。你在侧廊和厨房之间来回跑，等端出第一锅稀粥，车上的病人已经咳得直不起身。管事修女把库房门重新锁上，说今晚只能这样了。门外的风把油布吹得鼓起又落下。<<stress 6>><<tiredness 4>><<pain 1>><<else>>长椅挪开，草垫铺满侧廊，热水一桶桶提进来。病人喝了粥，咳嗽慢慢平下去。领队的老者把盐和干鱼留在门房，又把一枚铜钱按在你手里，说这是他们能拿出的谢礼。孩子在草垫上睡着了，手还攥着门框上的铜钉。其余的人挨着墙躺下，侧廊安静下来。<<money 90>><<set $mpDone_Temple_21 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<tending 1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回地底廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Vault]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 22 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
旧档室没有窗，空气比走廊冷一截。最里面那格的锁孔有新擦过的痕迹，铜屑落在柜脚；蓝布卷的布角露出一行你没见过的写法。主教的话还在耳边：「取来，交给我，不必让第三个人知道。」<<if mpNpcMet("Jordan")>>约旦在前殿替人念经，声音隔着两道门传过来。<<else>>前殿的诵声隔着两道门传过来。<<if mpNpcMet("Sydney")>>悉尼在谱室整理旧页，灯还亮着。<</if>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回回廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<link [[照令封好纸卷 (0:12)|MP Loc Temple Event 22 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 420 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpTempleEv22 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEv22 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>><<link [[买空匣顶替 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Event 22 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200>><<money -200>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEv22 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买空匣顶替 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Event 22 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEv22 to ($mpTempleEv22 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEv22 is "fail">>蓝布卷没能原样收好，绳结忽然崩开，纸页散在柜脚。你蹲下去一张张收，墨迹蹭在指腹上。走廊那头的诵声停了，有人正往这边走，你只好先把柜门合上。铜钥匙在锁眼里转了一下，没有锁到底。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<else>>你把纸卷原样捆好，用信封里的封蜡重新压了口，交到主教手里。主教没有拆，只把信封收进袖中，说了一句你办事稳。赏钱是当晚送到你手上的，送钱的人记住了你的脸。旧档室的门在你身后合上，廊下的灯还亮着。<<money 120>><<set $mpDone_Temple_22 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 2>><<mpalertgain "主教的侍从记住了你的脸">><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回回廊里 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Temple Season Extra 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple to ($mpLocEvents_Temple or 0)>>
补记房的石板边另挂一块窄木牌，画着新藤、灯、谷穗和封蜡，四样轮着换。<<if Time.season is "spring">>后园的土刚化冻，藤须还嫩。<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>彩窗把日头滤得发白。<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>风里带着葡萄发酵的酸气。<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>石阶上结着一层薄冰。<<else>>天光压在檐口，迟迟不散。<</if>>管事的修士说，这是节令供桌的牌：一年四次，把当季的供物摆到祭坛前。供桌上的铜瓶空着，灯罩蒙了一层灰，窄木牌的边角卷了起来。他敲了敲牌面：「供物是替人递的，不是替神收的。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回回廊 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpspringicon>><<link [[应季理供桌 (0:10)|MP Loc Temple Season Extra 2 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpTempleEvSeason2 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpTempleEvSeason2 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>><<link [[添买节令供物 (0:08)|MP Loc Temple Season Extra 2 After]]>><<pass 8>><<if ($money or 0) gte 150>><<money -150>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpTempleEvSeason2 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">添买节令供物 (0:08)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Temple Season Extra 2 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpTempleEvSeason2 to ($mpTempleEvSeason2 or "fail")>>
<<if $mpTempleEvSeason2 is "fail">>天色说变就变，你刚把供物摆上桌，穿堂风就把窄木牌吹翻，蜡台也歪了。收拾到一半，手头的活计再也接不下去，只能把散落的东西先归回筐里，袖口沾了一层灰。老修士没有说什么，只把窄木牌挂回钉子上。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<else>>你把铜瓶擦亮，换过灯芯，按节令把供物一一摆正，窄木牌也翻了个面。老修士在牌背添上一道浅痕，又替你把剩下的边角料收进抽屉。供桌前的灯稳稳烧到换班，廊下还留着一点蜡与谷穗的气味。<<set $mpDone_Temple_Season2 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Temple += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Temple to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Temple or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回回廊里 (0:02)|MP Loc Temple More2 Cloister]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回补记房木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[回到神殿总枢 (0:03)|MP Loc Temple Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
